<h1 class="tcs-policy-title">Shipping Policy</h1>
<div class="entry-content">

<p>This Shipping Policy explains where we ship, what it costs and how long your custom coffee sleeves take to arrive.</p>
<div>
<h2><strong>1. Where We Ship</strong></h2>
<p>We ship to addresses in the <strong>United States only</strong>. We do not ship to other countries.</p>
<h2><strong>2. Shipping Cost</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Shipping is free on every order</strong>, whatever the quantity. No shipping charge is added at checkout or to your invoice.</p>
<h2><strong>3. Production Time</strong></h2>
<p>Every sleeve is printed to order. Production takes <strong>7–10 business days</strong> after you approve your free digital proof and pay your invoice. Business days are Monday to Friday, excluding US public holidays.</p>
<h2><strong>4. Delivery Time</strong></h2>
<p>Once your order ships, delivery within the United States takes <strong>3–7 business days</strong>. Most orders arrive 10–17 business days after proof approval.</p>
<p>If anything on our side delays your order before it ships, we contact you by email. Carrier delays and severe weather can occasionally add time after your order leaves us.</p>
<h2><strong>5. Shipping Method and Tracking</strong></h2>
<p>Orders ship by tracked ground service with a reliable carrier. Sleeves are packed flat in bundles inside sturdy boxes. When your order ships, we email you a tracking number.</p>
<h2><strong>6. Incorrect or Incomplete Addresses</strong></h2>
<p>Please check your shipping address before you order. If a package comes back to us because of an incorrect address, a missing apartment or suite number or an undeliverable location, we will contact you, and reshipping may require an additional payment.</p>
<h2><strong>7. Lost or Missing Packages</strong></h2>
<p>If tracking shows your package as delivered but you cannot find it, check with neighbors or building management, look around your mailbox or doorstep, and allow 24 hours for carrier updates. If it is still missing, email <a href="mailto:info@thecoffeesleeves.com">info@thecoffeesleeves.com</a> and we will help you track it down with the carrier.</p>
<h2><strong>8. Damaged Shipments</strong></h2>
<p>If your sleeves arrive damaged, email us within 14 days of delivery with your order number and photos of the box and the sleeves. We send a free replacement or a refund and cover the shipping, as set out in our <a href="/refund_returns/">refund and returns policy</a>.</p>
<h2><strong>9. Contact Us</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+15034614788">(503) 461-4788</a> (Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm EST)<br /><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@thecoffeesleeves.com">info@thecoffeesleeves.com</a><br /><strong>Address:</strong><br />1639 70th St<br />Brooklyn, NY 11204<br />United States</p>
